00:00:19.653 --> 00:00:23.857 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Prochaine étape : ce vendredi

00:00:21.154 --> 00:00:25.392 size:53% position:73% line:53%
1er avril, alors qu'aura lieu

00:00:22.689 --> 00:00:27.427 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le tirage au sort des groupes

00:00:24.357 --> 00:00:28.929 size:53% position:73% line:53%
phase finale de

00:00:25.725 --> 00:00:30.464 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la Coupe du monde de soccer.

00:00:27.761 --> 00:00:32.065 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Le Canada occupe actuellement

00:00:29.262 --> 00:00:33.600 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le 33e rang du classement

00:00:30.797 --> 00:00:35.168 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de la FIFA, un sommet dans

00:00:32.399 --> 00:00:36.670 size:53% position:73% line:53%
son histoire.

00:00:33.934 --> 00:00:38.204 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Et qui sait ce que cette jeune

00:00:35.502 --> 00:00:39.706 size:53% position:73% line:53%
équipe, sans complexes,

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:41.241 size:53% position:73% line:53%
